  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.33333334326744 cup shortening",
    "1 cup milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0fmvzeoK9OcemqgYjaDRWIrcFd4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7040-JPs-big-daddy-biscuits-ddmfs-step-1-0766-3f78d5f39e6b4f7694b1f1651ed3b7bc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7040/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, baking powder, sugar, and salt together in a large bowl. Cut in shortening until the mixture resembles coarse crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tWc9mOOAWGov0Sjt9SMLN8Oujkk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7040-JPs-big-daddy-biscuits-ddmfs-step-2-0767-5ddd3625a32e42a390913ac4d3bec173.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7040/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually stir in milk until dough pulls away from the side of the bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6ek7D6KVQRIExNSLsUjjAR4JH9E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7040-JPs-big-daddy-biscuits-ddmfs-step-3-0768-512817d6f2934768a79db51a6215bc4d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7040/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn out onto a floured surface, and knead 15 to 20 times. Pat or roll dough out to 1 inch thick. Cut biscuits with a large cutter or juice glass dipped in flour. Repeat until all dough is used. Brush off the excess flour, and place biscuits onto an ungreased baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jJtzyTw-G9587og06-mTj6pY3Lk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7040-JPs-big-daddy-biscuits-ddmfs-step-4-0769-a9cc7100051c4b42877af57832c73bd1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7040/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the edges begin to brown, 13 to 15 minutes. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Mca_ObrdNwRDVjOGF7UoQNQO7KA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7040-jps-big-daddy-biscuits-DDMFS-4x3-f69667ff4fda4234aa9bdc5f78705796.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7040/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
